      {
        "n": "IN FOCUS: LEE SCRATCH PERRY (R)",
        "s": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-15T02:00:00Z",
        "d": "A radio tribute to the late dub mystic, Lee Scratch Perry, widely credited with pioneering the roots reggae and dub sounds through his extensive work behind the mixing desk in a career that spanned six decades. \n_ “I see the studio must be like a living thing, a life itself… The machine must be live and intelligent. Then I put my mind into the machine and the machine perform reality.”_",
        "j": "LEE SCRATCH PERRY",
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/in-focus/episodes/lee-scratch-perry-4th-september-2021",
