      {
        "n": "Séance Centre w/ Henk Den Toom Jr. (R)",
        "s": "2026-11-15T02:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-15T03:00:00Z",
        "d": "Canadian record label, publisher, and distributors Séance Centre conjure timeless music from the past, present, and future.\nFrom the host: \"For today’s episode Henk Den Toom Jr. has put together a very special mix of Sundanese kliningan music from Indonesia. Henk is a Dutch ex-pat who has lived in West Java for three decades where he has produced underground experimental hip hop and explores the vast landscape of Indonesian cassette tapes.\"",
